# Step 5 baseline artifacts are evidence, not source.
#
# Their SHA-256 hashes are recorded in supabase/baseline/MANIFEST.md and were
# proven by the Step 5 reproduction gate. core.autocrlf is true in this
# environment, so without this rule git would normalise line endings on commit
# or checkout and silently change the bytes — turning a verified artifact into
# a different file while the manifest still claimed the old hash.
#
# -text disables all end-of-line conversion for this directory.
supabase/baseline/** -text
